Scope and third-party material

These grants cover only copyright and database rights the licensor holds.
Shopify taxonomy material retains its MIT licence; see
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the source and full notice. Other third-party
software and bundled publication styles retain their existing terms.

The private source catalogue is outside the public release. Manuscript
text, manuscript figures and publisher style files are outside these grants
unless an individual file supplies its own licence notice.
